#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:1
msgid "Attribution"
msgstr "归因"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:3
msgid "Brinson-Fachler, Brinson-Hood-Beebower, Fama-French and style attribution."
msgstr "Brinson-Fachler、Brinson-Hood-Beebower、Fama-French 与风格归因。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:5
msgid ""
"See the [usage guide](../guides/metrics.md) for task-oriented examples. "
"Signatures below are generated from the public headers at the same commit as"
" the rest of this site."
msgstr "面向任务的示例参见[使用指南](../guides/metrics.md)。以下签名由与本站点其余内容同一提交的公共头文件生成。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:7
msgid ""
"Native owning facade corresponding to the source's stateful "
"BrinsonAttribution calculator."
msgstr "与源实现中有状态的 BrinsonAttribution 计算器相对应的原生所有权门面。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:7
msgid ""
"The facade stores an optional sector mapping and applies it to returns "
"(mean), benchmark returns (mean) and weights (sum) before delegating to the "
"canonical brinson_results kernel. Missing benchmark returns default to the "
"portfolio returns; missing weights default to equal weights. The native "
"result keeps the kernel's timestamp index and full effect columns (the "
"source's integer period column and RangeIndex are Python identity, not a "
"native claim)."
msgstr ""
"该门面存储一个可选的行业映射，并在委托给规范的 brinson_results "
"内核之前，将其应用于收益率（均值）、基准收益率（均值）与权重（求和）。缺失的基准收益率默认取组合收益率；缺失的权重默认取等权重。原生结果保留内核的时间戳索引与完整效应列（源实现中的整数周期列和"
" RangeIndex 属于 Python 侧的身份标识，并非原生声明）。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:7 ../../site/api/attribution.md:10
#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:13
msgid "Public Functions"
msgstr "公共函数"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:7
msgid "Constructs the facade with an optional sector mapping."
msgstr "使用可选的行业映射构造门面。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:7
msgid "The mapping is stored as supplied and validated when calculate runs."
msgstr "映射按传入原样存储，并在 calculate 运行时校验。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:7
msgid "Returns the stored sector-to-asset mapping."
msgstr "返回存储的行业到资产映射。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:7
msgid "Computes native Brinson attribution for the supplied returns."
msgstr "针对给定的收益率计算原生 Brinson 归因。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:7
msgid ""
"The method argument accepts brinson and the historical brinson_hood alias, "
"both selecting the BHB arithmetic decomposition. When a sector mapping is "
"present, returns and benchmark returns are averaged across each sector's "
"assets and weights are summed before attribution. Missing benchmark returns "
"default to the portfolio returns, missing weights default to equal weights, "
"and benchmark weights are always equal weights."
msgstr ""
"method 参数接受 brinson 以及历史别名 brinson_hood，两者都选择 BHB "
"算术分解。存在行业映射时，先对各行业的资产求收益率与基准收益率的均值、并对权重求和，再进行归因。缺失的基准收益率默认取组合收益率，缺失的权重默认取等权重，而基准权重始终为等权重。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md
msgid "Throws"
msgstr "抛出"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:10
msgid "Native owning Fama-French model facade."
msgstr "原生带所有权的 Fama-French 模型门面。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:10
msgid ""
"The model stores its specification (3factor, 5factor or 4factor_mom), risk-"
"free rate, fitted alpha and betas. Estimation delegates to the existing "
"native factor-regression kernel. All returned frames own their data."
msgstr ""
"该模型存储其设定（3factor、5factor 或 4factor_mom）、无风险利率以及拟合的 alpha 与 "
"beta。估计过程委托给既有的原生因子回归内核。所有返回的帧都自行持有数据。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:10
msgid "Constructs a Fama-French model for a supported specification."
msgstr "为受支持的设定构造 Fama-French 模型。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:10
msgid "Returns the configured model type."
msgstr "返回配置的模型类型。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:10
msgid "Returns the configured risk-free rate."
msgstr "返回配置的无风险利率。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:10
msgid "Returns the factor names selected by the model type."
msgstr "返回由模型类型选定的因子名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:10
msgid "Returns the fitted factor betas."
msgstr "返回拟合的因子 beta。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:10
msgid "Returns the fitted intercept."
msgstr "返回拟合的截距。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:10
msgid "Fits the configured model and stores its alpha and betas."
msgstr "拟合配置的模型并存储其 alpha 与 beta。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:10
msgid ""
"An empty returns_column selects the first double column, matching the "
"source's single-asset DataFrame behaviour. The fit delegates to the native "
"least-squares factor regression."
msgstr "returns_column 为空时选择第一个 double 列，与源实现的单资产 DataFrame 行为一致。拟合过程委托给原生最小二乘因子回归。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:10
msgid "Predicts fitted returns from factor data using the stored model."
msgstr "使用存储的模型由因子数据预测拟合收益。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:10
msgid ""
"The result is alpha + sum(beta_i * factor_i) for every input row and is "
"stored under the fitted_returns column."
msgstr "结果为每个输入行的 alpha + sum(beta_i * factor_i)，并存入 fitted_returns 列。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:10
msgid "Computes alpha and factor betas over expanding or trailing windows."
msgstr "在扩展窗口或滚动窗口上计算 alpha 与因子 beta。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:10
msgid ""
"rolling_window selects a trailing window; std::nullopt or zero uses an "
"expanding window from the first row. Rows with at most K observations for K "
"factors are NaN. This method does not update the model's stored alpha or "
"betas."
msgstr ""
"rolling_window 选择滚动窗口；std::nullopt 或零表示从首行开始的扩展窗口。对 K 个因子而言观测数不超过 K 的行为 "
"NaN。该方法不会更新模型存储的 alpha 或 beta。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:10
msgid "Fits the model and decomposes its mean return."
msgstr "拟合模型并分解其平均收益。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:10
msgid ""
"The returned map contains alpha, one <factor>_attribution entry per "
"configured factor (beta * mean(factor)), specific_return (the sum of those "
"contributions), common_return (the mean dependent return minus the "
"configured risk-free rate) and unexplained (common_return - alpha - "
"specific_return). The fit updates the model's stored alpha and betas."
msgstr ""
"返回的映射包含 alpha、每个配置因子一条 <factor>_attribution 记录（beta * "
"mean(factor)）、specific_return（这些贡献之和）、common_return（因变量平均收益减去配置的无风险利率）以及 "
"unexplained（common_return - alpha - specific_return）。拟合过程会更新模型存储的 alpha 与 "
"beta。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:13
msgid "Native owning facade for StyleResult."
msgstr "StyleResult 的原生所有权门面。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:13
msgid ""
"The source container exposes exposures, returns_by_style and overall_returns"
" plus deterministic summary/dictionary projections. The native class owns "
"copies of all three frames."
msgstr ""
"源容器暴露 exposures、returns_by_style 与 "
"overall_returns，以及确定性的摘要/字典投影。原生类持有这三张帧的副本。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:13
msgid "Constructs a result from three existing frames."
msgstr "由三张已有的帧构造结果。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:13
msgid "The frames are moved into the result and are not validated here."
msgstr "帧被移动进结果对象，此处不做校验。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:13
msgid "Constructs a result by consuming a style analysis result."
msgstr "通过消耗一个风格分析结果来构造结果。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:13
msgid "Returns the owned exposure frame."
msgstr "返回所持有的暴露帧。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:13
msgid "Returns the owned style/return summary frame."
msgstr "返回所持有的风格/收益摘要帧。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:13
msgid "Returns the owned portfolio return frame."
msgstr "返回所持有的组合收益帧。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:13
msgid "Returns a style -> average return mapping in deterministic key order."
msgstr "返回按确定性键序排列的风格到平均收益映射。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:13
msgid ""
"The style and return columns of returns_by_style are used when present; a "
"missing return column falls back to the first double column, and a missing "
"style column labels values by timestamp. Later duplicate style labels "
"replace earlier values."
msgstr ""
"存在时使用 returns_by_style 的 style 列与 return 列；缺少 return 列时回退到第一个 double 列，缺少 "
"style 列时以时间戳作为标签。后出现的重复风格标签会覆盖先前的值。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:13
msgid "Returns a dictionary of the three owned frames."
msgstr "返回三张所持帧的字典。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:13
msgid ""
"Keys are exposures, returns_by_style and overall_returns; each value is a "
"detached copy."
msgstr "键为 exposures、returns_by_style 与 overall_returns；每个值都是独立副本。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:16
msgid "Attribution inputs after asset and date alignment."
msgstr "资产与日期对齐之后的归因输入。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:16 ../../site/api/attribution.md:19
#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:22 ../../site/api/attribution.md:25
#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:28 ../../site/api/attribution.md:31
#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:34 ../../site/api/attribution.md:37
