msgid "Public Members"
msgstr "公共成员"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:16
msgid "Returns restricted to aligned dates."
msgstr "限定为对齐日期的收益率。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:16
msgid "Positions with unloaded non-cash assets and unaligned dates removed."
msgstr "剔除未载入的非现金资产与未对齐日期后的持仓。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:16
msgid "Factor returns restricted to aligned dates."
msgstr "限定为对齐日期的因子收益率。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:16
msgid "Loadings copied unchanged from the input table."
msgstr "从输入表原样复制的载荷。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:16
msgid "Alignment warnings, with the missing-asset warning first."
msgstr "对齐警告，缺失资产警告排在最前。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:19
msgid "Summed Brinson effects and compounded returns across all periods."
msgstr "跨所有周期的 Brinson 效应求和与复利收益。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:19
msgid "Sum of the period allocation effects."
msgstr "各期配置效应之和。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:19
msgid "Sum of the period selection effects."
msgstr "各期选择效应之和。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:19
msgid "Sum of the period interaction effects."
msgstr "各期交互效应之和。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:19
msgid "Sum of the period total effects."
msgstr "各期总效应之和。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:19
msgid "Compounded portfolio return, wealth - 1."
msgstr "复利组合收益，即 wealth - 1。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:19
msgid "Compounded benchmark return, wealth - 1."
msgstr "复利基准收益，即 wealth - 1。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:22
msgid "Brinson-Hood-Beebower effects for one period."
msgstr "单期的 Brinson-Hood-Beebower 效应。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:22
msgid ""
"Each effect is the direct arithmetic contribution for that period; no "
"normalization or compounding is applied."
msgstr "每个效应都是该期的直接算术贡献；不做归一化或复利处理。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:22
msgid "Allocation effect for the period."
msgstr "该期的配置效应。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:22
msgid "Selection effect for the period."
msgstr "该期的选择效应。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:22
msgid "Interaction effect for the period."
msgstr "该期的交互效应。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:22
msgid "Sum of allocation, selection and interaction."
msgstr "配置、选择与交互之和。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:22
msgid "Weighted portfolio return for the period."
msgstr "该期的加权组合收益。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:22
msgid "Weighted benchmark return for the period."
msgstr "该期的加权基准收益。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:25
msgid "Factor-loading table aligned by date, asset and factor labels."
msgstr "按日期、资产与因子标签对齐的因子载荷表。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:25
msgid ""
"values is a flattened dates x assets x factors buffer; NaN marks a missing "
"loading. align_and_warn requires its length to match the label dimensions "
"and uses the date and asset labels for alignment."
msgstr ""
"values 是展平的 dates x assets x factors 缓冲区；NaN 标记缺失的载荷。align_and_warn "
"要求其长度与标签维度匹配，并使用日期与资产标签进行对齐。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:25
msgid "Dates with available loadings."
msgstr "存在可用载荷的日期。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:25
msgid "Asset identifiers with loadings."
msgstr "具有载荷的资产标识。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:25
msgid "Factor identifiers."
msgstr "因子标识。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:25
msgid "Flat loading values, NaN if missing."
msgstr "展平的载荷值，缺失时为 NaN。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:28
msgid "Result of an ordinary least-squares factor regression."
msgstr "普通最小二乘因子回归的结果。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:28
msgid ""
"All frames own their data. coefficients has an ordinal index and the columns"
" factor and coefficient, with alpha first followed by the requested factor "
"names in request order."
msgstr ""
"所有帧都自行持有数据。coefficients 具有序号索引以及 factor 与 coefficient 列，alpha "
"在前，其后是按请求顺序排列的因子名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:28 ../../site/api/attribution.md:31
msgid "Estimated intercept."
msgstr "估计的截距。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:28
msgid "1 - SSE/SST; 0 for exactly constant returns."
msgstr "1 - SSE/SST；收益完全恒定时为 0。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:28
msgid "Alpha and factor coefficient table."
msgstr "alpha 与因子系数表。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:28 ../../site/api/attribution.md:31
msgid "Fitted values on the returns index."
msgstr "在收益率索引上的拟合值。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:28
msgid "Observed minus fitted values on the returns index."
msgstr "在收益率索引上的观测值减拟合值。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:31
msgid "Result of the native OLS Fama-French fit."
msgstr "原生 OLS Fama-French 拟合的结果。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:31
msgid ""
"The native kernel is the canonical least-squares factor regression. The "
"Python Newey-West/WLS covariance options are not part of that kernel, so "
"std_errors/p_values are deliberately absent rather than fabricated."
msgstr ""
"原生内核即规范的最小二乘因子回归。Python 的 Newey-West/WLS 协方差选项不属于该内核，因此有意不提供 "
"std_errors/p_values，而不是伪造它们。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:31
msgid "Factor name to fitted beta."
msgstr "因子名称到拟合 beta。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:31
msgid "Regression R-squared from the native fit."
msgstr "原生拟合得到的回归 R 方。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:31
msgid "Observed minus fitted values."
msgstr "观测值减拟合值。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:34
msgid "Result of the idiosyncratic-risk calculation."
msgstr "特异性风险计算的结果。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:34
msgid "Asset names in column order."
msgstr "按列顺序排列的资产名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:34
msgid "Specific volatility per asset."
msgstr "各资产的特异性波动率。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:34
msgid "Beta applied to every asset."
msgstr "应用于所有资产的 beta。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:37
msgid "Inputs controlling style exposure construction."
msgstr "控制风格暴露构造的输入。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:37
msgid ""
"Optional per-asset vectors must either be empty or contain one finite value "
"per asset column. When market_caps is empty the size styles are replaced by "
"equal_weight. value_scores takes precedence over book_to_price when both are"
" supplied."
msgstr ""
"可选的逐资产向量必须为空，或为每个资产列包含一个有限值。当 market_caps 为空时，规模风格由 equal_weight 替代。同时提供时 "
"value_scores 优先于 book_to_price。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:37
msgid "Per-asset market caps."
msgstr "逐资产市值。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:37
msgid "Per-asset book-to-price values."
msgstr "逐资产的账面市值比。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:37
msgid "Per-asset value scores."
msgstr "逐资产的价值得分。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:37
msgid "Trailing momentum observations."
msgstr "回溯动量观测值。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:37
msgid "Lower and upper size cutoffs in [0, 1]."
msgstr "落在 [0, 1] 内的规模上下分界。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:40
msgid "Frames produced by style_analysis."
msgstr "style_analysis 产生的帧。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:40
msgid "Asset rows with one column per style."
msgstr "资产为行、每个风格一列。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:40
msgid "Style names and average style returns."
msgstr "风格名称与风格平均收益。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:40
msgid "Equal-weighted returns on the input index."
msgstr "在输入索引上的等权重收益。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:43
msgid "Aligns attribution inputs to the positions' assets and loading dates."
msgstr "将归因输入对齐到持仓的资产与载荷日期。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:43
msgid ""
"Position assets without loadings are dropped (except cash) and dates without"
" loadings are removed from returns, positions and factor returns. Warnings "
"are returned in warnings instead of being emitted. Transaction turnover "
"checks and stacked Series positions are not represented by this typed "
"surface."
msgstr ""
"没有载荷的持仓资产会被丢弃（现金除外），没有载荷的日期会从收益率、持仓与因子收益率中移除。警告通过 warnings "
"返回而不是直接发出。成交换手检查与堆叠 Series 形式的持仓不在这个带类型的接口面之中。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:46
msgid "Computes per-style return series using default style analysis."
msgstr "使用默认风格分析计算逐风格收益序列。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:46
msgid ""
"Runs style_analysis with default options and passes its exposures to the "
"two-frame overload. Empty-shaped input yields an empty frame."
msgstr "以默认选项运行 style_analysis，并将其暴露传入双帧重载。空形状的输入产生空帧。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:49
msgid "Computes per-style return series from explicit style exposures."
msgstr "由显式风格暴露计算逐风格收益序列。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:49
msgid ""
"The exposure frame must have an ordinal index, exactly one string asset "
"column named asset and at least one double style column. Rows are aligned to"
" return columns by asset identity; missing assets contribute zero and extra "
"exposure assets are ignored. A style with a positive aligned weight total is"
" normalized to sum to one; a style with a non-positive total produces an "
"all-zero return series. Empty-shaped inputs, or an exposure frame with no "
"double style columns, yield an empty frame."
msgstr ""
"暴露帧必须具有序号索引、恰好一个名为 asset 的字符串列，以及至少一个 double "
"风格列。行按资产身份与收益列对齐；缺失的资产贡献为零，多余的暴露资产被忽略。对齐权重之和为正的风格会被归一化使其和为 "
"1；总和为非正的风格产生全零的收益序列。空形状输入，或没有 double 风格列的暴露帧，产生空帧。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:52
msgid "Computes single-period Brinson-Hood-Beebower attribution."
msgstr "计算单期 Brinson-Hood-Beebower 归因。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:52
msgid ""
"Every input frame must contain a double column for each sector in "
"sector_column_names and all four frames must share the same unique index. "
"The supplied weights are used as given, without normalization."
msgstr ""
"每个输入帧都必须为 sector_column_names 中的每个行业包含一个 double "
"列，且四个帧必须共享同一唯一索引。给定的权重按原样使用，不做归一化。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:55
msgid "Computes summed effects and compounded returns across all periods."
msgstr "计算跨所有周期的效应之和与复利收益。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:55
msgid ""
"The four effect fields are arithmetic sums of the per-period brinson_results"
" columns, while portfolio_cumulative and benchmark_cumulative compound the "
"per-period portfolio and benchmark returns as wealth - 1."
msgstr ""
"四个效应字段是逐期 brinson_results 列的算术求和，而 portfolio_cumulative 与 "
"benchmark_cumulative 将逐期组合与基准收益按 wealth - 1 复利累积。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:58
msgid "Computes one row of Brinson-Hood-Beebower effects per input period."
msgstr "为每个输入周期计算一行 Brinson-Hood-Beebower 效应。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:58
msgid ""
"Each input frame must contain a double column for every sector in "
"sector_column_names, and all four frames must share the same unique index. "
"The result keeps that index and holds the allocation, selection, "
"interaction, total, portfolio_return and benchmark_return columns."
msgstr ""
"每个输入帧都必须为 sector_column_names 中的每个行业包含一个 double 列，且四个帧必须共享同一唯一索引。结果保留该索引，并包含"
" allocation、selection、interaction、total、portfolio_return 与 benchmark_return "
"列。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:61
msgid "Calculates asset-specific volatility from factor data."
msgstr "由因子数据计算资产的特异性波动率。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:61
msgid ""
"When market_beta is absent, the beta is fitted by ordinary least squares of "
"the first asset's excess returns on the five Fama-French columns (MKT, SMB, "
"HML, RMW, CMA) and then applied to every asset, matching the pinned routine."
" Specific volatility is the square root of total variance minus beta^2 times"
" market variance, using risk-free-shifted population variances; a non-"
"positive residual variance yields zero."
msgstr ""
"未提供 market_beta 时，先用普通最小二乘将第一个资产的超额收益对五个 Fama-French "
"列（MKT、SMB、HML、RMW、CMA）回归得到 beta，然后将其应用于所有资产，与固定版本的例程一致。特异性波动率为总方差减去 beta^2 "
"倍市场方差后的平方根，方差使用剔除无风险利率后的总体方差计算；残差方差为非正时取零。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:64
msgid "Computes automatic style attribution from a default style analysis."
msgstr "基于默认风格分析计算自动风格归因。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:64
msgid ""
"Runs style_analysis with default options, builds style return series with "
"analyze_performance_by_style, and assigns each style its centered Pearson "
"correlation with the equal-weighted portfolio return multiplied by the "
"style's mean return. The residual is the portfolio mean minus the sum of "
"contributions. A style with fewer than three paired observations or near-"
"zero paired deviation contributes zero. Empty-shaped input yields an empty "
"frame."
msgstr ""
"以默认选项运行 style_analysis，使用 analyze_performance_by_style "
"构造风格收益序列，并为每个风格赋予其与等权组合收益的中心化 Pearson "
"相关系数乘以该风格的平均收益。残量为组合均值减去各贡献之和。配对观测少于三个或配对偏差接近零的风格贡献为零。空形状的输入产生空帧。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:67
msgid "Computes style attribution for explicit portfolio and style returns."
msgstr "针对显式给出的组合与风格收益计算风格归因。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:67
msgid ""
"The portfolio series is the row-wise mean of all double columns in "
"portfolio_returns. Selected style columns are aligned by timestamp; a style "
"contributes its centered Pearson correlation with the portfolio series "
"multiplied by its mean on the aligned timestamps. Styles are emitted in "
"style_returns column order, followed by the residual row, which uses the "
"full portfolio mean. Unmatched selectors are ignored. A style with fewer "
"than three paired timestamps or near-zero aligned deviation contributes "
"zero. An empty-shaped portfolio yields an empty frame."
msgstr ""
"组合序列为 portfolio_returns 中所有 double 列的行均值。所选风格列按时间戳对齐；每个风格的贡献是其与组合序列的中心化 "
"Pearson 相关系数乘以在对齐时间戳上的均值。风格按 style_returns "
"的列顺序输出，其后是使用完整组合均值的残量行。未匹配的选取项被忽略。配对时间戳少于三个或对齐偏差接近零的风格贡献为零。空形状的组合产生空帧。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:70
msgid "Computes rolling cross-sectional style tilt indicators."
msgstr "计算滚动截面的风格倾斜指标。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:70
msgid ""
"Each output row uses the trailing window observations ending before that "
"row. Size splits the average rank of the latest return at the one-third and "
"two-thirds cutoffs (lower third _large, upper third _small); winner/loser "
"splits the compounded trailing return at zero; value/growth splits its "
"average rank at the median; high/low volatility splits the sample deviation "
"of at most the last 60 observations at the median, with ties assigned to "
"high volatility. Output columns are phase-major: all <asset>_large columns, "
"then all <asset>_small columns, then <asset>_winner, <asset>_loser, "
"<asset>_value, <asset>_growth, <asset>_high_vol and <asset>_low_vol, with "
"assets in input column order within each phase."
msgstr ""
"每个输出行使用在该行之前结束的滚动窗口观测。规模按最新收益的平均秩在三分之一与三分之二分界处划分（下三分之一为 _large，上三分之一为 "
"_small）；winner/loser 以零为界划分复利滚动收益；value/growth 以中位数为界划分其平均秩；high/low "
"volatility 以中位数为界划分至多最近 60 个观测的样本标准差，并列归入 high volatility。输出列按阶段为主序：先是所有 "
"<asset>_large 列，然后所有 <asset>_small 列，随后是 "
"<asset>_winner、<asset>_loser、<asset>_value、<asset>_growth、<asset>_high_vol 与"
" <asset>_low_vol，每个阶段内资产按输入列顺序排列。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:73
msgid ""
"Decomposes mean returns into alpha, factor, specific, common and unexplained"
" components."
msgstr "将平均收益分解为 alpha、因子、特异、共同与未解释部分。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:73
msgid ""
"The factors are fitted by ordinary least squares, each factor contributes "
"beta * mean(factor), and specific_return is the sum of those contributions. "
"common_return is mean(returns) - risk_free_rate and unexplained is "
"common_return - alpha - specific_return. The output index is ordinal and "
"rows follow this order: alpha, each <factor>_attribution in request order, "
"specific_return, common_return and unexplained."
msgstr ""
"因子通过普通最小二乘拟合，每个因子贡献 beta * mean(factor)，specific_return "
"为这些贡献之和。common_return 为 mean(returns) - risk_free_rate，unexplained 为 "
"common_return - alpha - specific_return。输出索引为序号，行按此顺序排列：alpha、按请求顺序的每个 "
"<factor>_attribution、specific_return、common_return 与 unexplained。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:76
msgid "Predicts returns from a fitted factor regression."
msgstr "由已拟合的因子回归预测收益。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:76
msgid ""
"The coefficient table in regression must be structurally valid: an ordinal "
"index of length K + 1 and the factor/coefficient columns, with alpha first "
"and the remaining labels matching factor_column_names in order. Predictions "
"are alpha + sum(beta_i * factor_i) for each input row."
msgstr ""
"回归中的系数表必须在结构上有效：长度为 K + 1 的序号索引以及 factor/coefficient 列，alpha 在前，其余标签按顺序与 "
"factor_column_names 匹配。预测值为每个输入行的 alpha + sum(beta_i * factor_i)。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:79
msgid "Fetches Fama-French factors through an explicit provider."
msgstr "通过显式的数据提供方获取 Fama-French 因子。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:79
msgid ""
"copy is retained for source-signature compatibility. Native results always "
"own their buffers; a provider cannot hand ownership of cached data to the "
"caller, so both values of copy return a detached value."
msgstr "保留 copy 参数是为了与源签名兼容。原生结果始终自行持有缓冲区；提供方不能把缓存数据的所有权交给调用方，因此 copy 的两个取值都返回独立副本。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:82
msgid "Fetches Fama-French factors with the library defaulting to french."
msgstr "获取 Fama-French 因子，库默认取 french。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:85
msgid "Fetches style factors through an injected provider."
msgstr "通过注入的提供方获取风格因子。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:88
msgid "Fetches style factors with the library defaulting to us."
msgstr "获取风格因子，库默认取 us。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:91
msgid "Fits an ordinary least-squares factor regression with an intercept."
msgstr "拟合带截距的普通最小二乘因子回归。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:91
msgid ""
"The dependent column is regressed on the named factor columns. Both frames "
"must share the same unique index, selected values must be finite, and at "
"least K + 1 observations are required for K factors. The fit uses a "
"Householder QR solve and rejects rank-deficient designs."
msgstr ""
"将因变量列对指定的因子列做回归。两个帧必须共享同一唯一索引，选取的值必须有限，且 K 个因子至少需要 K + 1 个观测。拟合使用 "
"Householder QR 求解，并拒绝秩亏的设计矩阵。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:94
msgid "Computes rolling or expanding factor exposures by least squares."
msgstr "用最小二乘计算滚动或扩展的因子暴露。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:94
msgid ""
"Each output row fits the requested factors on the window ending at that row."
" A supplied rolling_window limits the window to that many trailing "
"observations; std::nullopt uses an expanding window from the first row. Rows"
" with at most K observations for K factors are NaN."
msgstr ""
"每个输出行在截至该行的窗口上拟合所请求的因子。给定 rolling_window 时窗口限制为该数量的末尾观测；std::nullopt "
"表示从首行开始的扩展窗口。对 K 个因子而言观测数不超过 K 的行为 NaN。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:97
msgid "Computes style exposures and style return summaries."
msgstr "计算风格暴露与风格收益摘要。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:97
msgid ""
"Every asset column must be double, have a distinct non-empty name and "
"contain finite values. The exposure table has one row per asset and one "
"column per constructed style; returns_by_style reports each style's "
"arithmetic mean return; overall_returns reports the equal-weighted portfolio"
" return on the input timestamps. A style with no eligible assets receives "
"zero weights and a NaN summary return."
msgstr ""
"每个资产列都必须为 double、名称互不相同且非空，并包含有限值。暴露表每个资产一行、每个构造出的风格一列；returns_by_style "
"报告每个风格的算术平均收益；overall_returns 在输入时间戳上报告等权组合收益。没有合格资产的风格得到零权重和 NaN 摘要收益。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:100
msgid ""
"Source-compatible compatibility facade for "
"fincore.attribution.fama_french_patch.FamaFrenchModelPatch."
msgstr "与源实现兼容的 fincore.attribution.fama_french_patch.FamaFrenchModelPatch 兼容门面。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:100
msgid ""
"The patch module documented the same model specification fields as the "
"canonical Fama-French model (model_type, risk_free_rate, selected factors "
"and fitted betas). It adds no independent computation in the pinned source, "
"so the native alias deliberately maps to the owning FamaFrenchModel rather "
"than duplicating estimation state."
msgstr ""
"该补丁模块记录了与规范 Fama-French 模型相同的模型设定字段（model_type、risk_free_rate、所选因子与拟合 "
"beta）。在固定版本的源实现中它不引入独立计算，因此原生别名有意映射到带所有权的 FamaFrenchModel，而不是复制估计状态。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:103
msgid "Injected provider boundary for Fama-French data."
msgstr "Fama-French 数据的注入式提供方边界。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:103
msgid ""
"The provider is supplied explicitly on every call; there is no process-"
"global provider or cache state. The returned frame is validated and detached"
" (deep-copied) by fetch_ff_factors."
msgstr "每次调用都显式提供提供方；不存在进程全局的提供方或缓存状态。返回的帧由 fetch_ff_factors 校验并复制为独立副本（深拷贝）。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:106
msgid "Injected style-factor provider boundary."
msgstr "注入式的风格因子提供方边界。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:106
msgid ""
"The provider receives an explicit factors option (nullopt mirrors the "
"source's None) and returns a validated, detached frame."
msgstr "提供方接收一个显式的 factors 选项（nullopt 对应源实现中的 None），并返回经过校验的独立帧。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:109
msgid "Standard three-factor Fama-French definitions, matching the pinned source."
msgstr "标准三因子 Fama-French 定义，与固定版本源实现一致。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:112
msgid "Four-factor Fama-French definitions with the momentum factor."
msgstr "包含动量因子的四因子 Fama-French 定义。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:115
msgid "Standard five-factor Fama-French definitions, matching the pinned source."
msgstr "标准五因子 Fama-French 定义，与固定版本源实现一致。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:118
msgid "Name of the Brinson allocation-effect column."
msgstr "Brinson 配置效应列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:121
msgid "Name of the Brinson benchmark-return column."
msgstr "Brinson 基准收益列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:124
msgid "Name of the Brinson interaction-effect column."
msgstr "Brinson 交互效应列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:127
msgid "Name of the Brinson portfolio-return column."
msgstr "Brinson 组合收益列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:130
msgid "Name of the Brinson selection-effect column."
msgstr "Brinson 选择效应列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:133
msgid "Name of the Brinson total-effect column."
msgstr "Brinson 总效应列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:136
msgid "Name of the component-label column in an attribution summary."
msgstr "归因摘要中成分标签列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:139
msgid "Name of the contribution-value column in an attribution summary."
msgstr "归因摘要中贡献值列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:142
msgid "Name of the predicted-return column."
msgstr "预测收益列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:145
msgid "Label used for the regression intercept."
msgstr "用于回归截距的标签。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:148
msgid "Name of the coefficient-value column in a coefficient frame."
msgstr "系数帧中系数值列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:151
msgid "Name of the factor-label column in a coefficient frame."
msgstr "系数帧中因子标签列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:154
msgid "Name of the fitted-return column."
msgstr "拟合收益列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:157
msgid "Name of the residual column."
msgstr "残差列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:160
msgid "Name of the string column holding asset identifiers in exposures."
msgstr "暴露表中存放资产标识的字符串列名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:163
msgid "Name of the double column holding style attribution contributions."
msgstr "存放风格归因贡献的 double 列名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:166
msgid "Name of the residual row in style attribution results."
msgstr "风格归因结果中残量行的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:169
msgid "Name of the equal-weight style column."
msgstr "等权风格列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:172
msgid "Name of the growth style column."
msgstr "成长风格列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:175
msgid "Name of the high-volatility style column."
msgstr "高波动风格列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:178
msgid "Name of the large-cap size style column."
msgstr "大盘规模风格列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:181
msgid "Name of the momentum-loser style column."
msgstr "动量输家风格列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:184
msgid "Name of the low-volatility style column."
msgstr "低波动风格列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:187
msgid "Name of the mid-cap size style column."
msgstr "中盘规模风格列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:190
msgid "Name of the string column holding style names."
msgstr "存放风格名称的字符串列名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:193
msgid "Name of the double column holding style or portfolio returns."
msgstr "存放风格或组合收益的 double 列名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:196
msgid "Name of the small-cap size style column."
msgstr "小盘规模风格列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:199
msgid "Name of the value style column."
msgstr "价值风格列的名称。"

#: ../../site/api/attribution.md:202
msgid "Name of the momentum-winner style column."
msgstr "动量赢家风格列的名称。"

